  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Easily encode files used in business processes",
    "splashDescription": "Orchestrate file-heavy and document-centric business processes that involve services such as DocuSign by sending encoded PDFs through HTTP requests.This Connector increases makes it easy to encode a file in Base64 format and transmit it via API request. This Connector is ideal for scenarios where APIs or systems only accept files as text strings (such as JSON payloads) as it ensures seamless and secure file transfer without corruption.",
